<title>BRAZIL: Banco BMC to price $50 mln, putable 8-yr bond Mon.</title>
<headline>Banco BMC to price $50 mln, putable 8-yr bond Mon.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian commercial bank BMC is scheduled Monday to launch its $50 million, eight-year Eurobond, with puts and calls after three and five years, said lead manager West Merchant Bank.</p>
<p>Pricing of the bond was also scheduled Monday, with price talk at between 380 to 410 basis points over U.S. Treasuries, a West Merchant official said.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
